# Chuan hoa xuong dong (2026-09-14, chu du an duyet khi "merge ve 1 moi"):
# repo luu LF; checkout tren Windows cung LF de test doc ma nguon tu dia
# (readFileSync + so chuoi "\n") khong doi mau theo core.autocrlf cua may.
# Index da la LF 100% (0/11.567 tep i/crlf) => khong can renormalize.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Script Windows can CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

